{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c39f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a19f99-4738-7a00-8603-e2ade28c5d89"},"sequence":42,"recorded_at":1780531400000079,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a19f99-4b98-7062-9672-dd028f5604cd","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a19f99-4b98-7062-9672-dd028f5604cd","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a19f99-4b98-7062-9672-dd028f5604cd"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a19f99-5729-7d72-a31f-4e9bcf547ee0"},"task_id":"01a19f99-5729-7d72-a31f-4e9bcf547ee0","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a19f99-5729-7d72-a31f-4e9bcf547ee0","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/maximilianmilovidov/.t3/worktrees/agencydiff/t3-b30a56e3/eval/followup/external-app/attempts/A-settings-0/snapshot.txt`.\n1|# ntfy web UI snapshot (for blind interface tasks)\n2|\n3|Recorded from the isolated local instance (ntfy 2.36.0, fresh profile,\n4|one subscribed topic `example-topic`). Text and structure only; no\n5|implementation internals.\n6|\n7|## Top navigation (left sidebar)\n8|\n9|- Button: All notifications\n10|- Section: Subscribed topics\n11|  - Button: `<topic name>` (selects the topic; each topic row also has a\n12|    small nested menu button that opens the topic menu)\n13|- Button: Settings\n14|- Button: Documentation\n15|- Button: Publish notification (opens a publish dialog)\n16|- Button: Subscribe to topic (opens the subscribe dialog below)\n17|\n18|First-run note: on a brand-new profile a dismissible banner asks for\n19|browser notification permission (\"Notifications are disabled / GRANT NOW\"\n20|+ Close). The \"Subscribe to topic\" nav button appears after the banner\n21|is dismissed.\n22|\n23|## Subscribe-to-topic dialog\n24|\n25|- Heading: \"Subscribe to topic\"\n26|- Paragraph: \"Topics may not be password-protected, so choose a name\n27|  that's not easy to guess. Once subscribed, you can PUT/POST\n28|  notifications.\"\n29|- Text field labeled \"Topic name, e.g. phil_alerts\"\n30|- Button: GENERATE NAME (fills in a random name)\n31|- Switch: \"Use another server\"\n32|- Footer buttons: CANCEL, SUBSCRIBE\n33|\n34|## Topic menu (per subscribed topic, via the row's menu button)\n35|\n36|- Change display name\n37|- Send test notification\n38|- Clear all notifications\n39|- Mute notifications (flips to \"Unmute notifications\" while muted; a\n40|  muted-indicator icon appears beside the topic row)\n41|- Unsubscribe (removes the subscription immediately)\n42|\n43|## Settings page, Notifications section (rows; each row is label +\n44|// description + a value control)\n45|\n46|- \"Notification sound\" — \"Notifications play the Ding sound when they\n47|  arrive\" — value control (current: Ding)\n48|- \"Minimum priority\" — \"Showing all notifications, regardless of\n49|  priority\" — value control (current: Any priority)\n50|- \"Delete notifications\" — \"Notifications are auto-deleted after one\n51|  week\" — value control (current: After one week; offers Never, After\n52|  three hours, After one day, After one week, After one month)\n53|\n54|(Further Settings sections exist below: appearance, date/time format,\n55|language, user management. They are out of scope for these tasks.)","final_result":true}}}
